1
00:00:00,065 --> 00:00:01,775
Ah, hmm.

2
00:00:05,904 --> 00:00:07,154
(Penny:)Oh, God, no, I can't.

3
00:00:07,323 --> 00:00:10,363
Look, Sheldon, honey, I don't want things
to be weird between us.

4
00:00:10,534 --> 00:00:14,124
(Sheldon:)Won't it also be weird if I have to say
hello to you on my way to work...

5
00:00:14,288 --> 00:00:18,168
(Sheldon:)...and you're living in a refrigerator box
and washing your hair with rain water?

6
00:00:19,585 --> 00:00:21,375
(Penny:)I'll pay you back as soon as I can.

7
00:00:21,545 --> 00:00:23,005
(Sheldon:)Of course you will.

8
00:00:23,505 --> 00:00:25,845
(Sheldon:)It's impossible to pay me back
sooner than you can.

9
00:00:26,925 --> 00:00:31,175
Assuming you've subscribed to a linear
understanding of time and causality.

10
00:00:32,431 --> 00:00:34,891
(Penny:)I'm regretting this already.

11
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:41,230
(Sheldon:)You know,
I've given the matter some thought...

12
00:00:41,398 --> 00:00:45,898
(Sheldon:)...and I think I'd be willing to be a house
pet to a race of super-intelligent aliens.

13
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,610
(Leonard:)Interesting.

14
00:00:49,782 --> 00:00:51,702
(Sheldon:)Ask me why.

15
00:00:52,451 --> 00:00:53,951
(Leonard:)Do I have to?

16
00:00:54,119 --> 00:00:57,019
(Sheldon:)Of course. That's how you move
a conversation forward.

